---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE, WHATSAPP } from "../../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="Activewear Dropshipping: Complete Start-to-Scale Guide" description="Everything you need to start an activewear dropshipping business. From finding suppliers to building a store and driving your first sales without holding inventory.">
    <section style="background:var(--color-primary);color:white;">
    <div style="max-width:56rem;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
        <span style="font-size:1.5rem;">🏪</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent-light);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding:0.2rem 0.75rem;border-radius:9999px;">Beginner</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:#94a3b8;">12 min read</span>
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;">Activewear Dropshipping: Complete Start-to-Scale Guide</h1>
    <p style="color:#94a3b8;max-width:42rem;margin:0 auto;">Everything you need to start an activewear dropshipping business. From finding suppliers to building a store and driving your first sales without holding inventory.</p>
    </div>
    </section>

    <div style="max-width:56rem;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;">
    <div style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:1rem;padding:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
    
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Why Dropship Activewear</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Activewear is one of the best niches for dropshipping because customers cannot judge fabric quality from photos alone, they want variety (multiple styles and colors), and they frequently reorder. Unlike gadgets where customers compare specs, activewear buyers respond to aesthetics, fit descriptions, and social proof - all of which you can provide without holding stock.</p>
    


      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Setting Up Your Store for Dropshipping</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Best platforms for activewear dropshipping: Shopify (cleanest checkout, best apps), WooCommerce (lower cost but more technical), TikTok Shop (fastest growth, lowest fees). Essential apps: DSers or Zendrop for AliExpress sourcing, Loox or Judge.me for reviews, PageFly or Gempages for landing pages. Do not overcomplicate your tech stack - start simple.</p>
    


      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Sourcing Without Alibaba</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">Direct supplier dropshipping (like ordering from us) beats AliExpress for activewear because: faster shipping (3-7 days vs 15-30 days from China via AliExpress), higher quality control, and real inventory data. Our MOQ of 10 pieces per style for dropshipping is perfect for testing multiple styles without committing to large orders.</p>
    


      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Shipping and Delivery Expectations</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.8;">AliExpress dropshipping typically takes 15-30 days to the US. Our direct dropshipping ships in 3-7 days to most countries via express courier. Set accurate delivery expectations on your product pages (e.g., "Delivery: 5-10 business days"). Customers who know what to expect leave fewer negative reviews.</p>
    
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.25rem;text-align:center;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-wrap" style="<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
    
      <details class="faq-item" style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">What is blind dropshipping and why does it matter?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow"style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;"transition:transform 0.2s ease; fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Blind dropshipping means your customer receives a plain package with no reference to your supplier - no invoices, pricing, or supplier branding inside. This makes it look like you hold your own inventory and builds trust in your brand. We provide blind shipping for all dropshipping orders at no extra charge.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">How do I handle returns as a dropshipper?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow"style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;"transition:transform 0.2s ease; fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Set up a clear returns policy on your store (7-day return window for unused items is standard). When a customer requests a return, you coordinate with us and either provide a replacement or refund. The key: respond within 24 hours, be accommodating, and handle the customer directly. How you handle returns defines your brand reputation more than the product itself.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">What is a realistic monthly income from activewear dropshipping?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow"style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;"transition:transform 0.2s ease; fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Most new dropshippers make $500-2,000/month in year one. After 12 months of optimization, $3,000-10,000/month is achievable. Top performers doing $20,000+/month combine multiple channels (Shopify + TikTok Shop + Instagram) and have built a following. Income scales with audience size and marketing skill, not just product quality.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">Do I need business licenses to dropship activewear?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow"style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;"transition:transform 0.2s ease; fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">In most countries, a sole proprietorship is sufficient to start. Form an LLC once you exceed $1,000/month in revenue for liability protection. You do need to collect and remit sales tax once you have economic nexus in a state (typically $100K in sales). Use TaxJar or Avalara to automate sales tax compliance across states.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden;">
        <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.25rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;gap:1rem;">
          <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);font-size:0.9rem;">How do I handle customer complaints about shipping time?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow"style="width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-light);flex-shrink:0;"transition:transform 0.2s ease; fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding:0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">Prevent complaints by setting accurate expectations on checkout pages. When complaints arise, acknowledge the delay, apologize, and offer a solution: partial refund, discount on next order, or express re-shipment. Keep the conversation on WhatsApp for fast resolution. Proactive communication turns complaining customers into loyal repeat buyers.</div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div style="background:var(--color-secondary);border-radius:1.5rem;padding:2rem;text-align:center;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Have More Questions?</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-light);margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Get personalized answers for your specific business on WhatsApp.</p>
      <a href={WHATSAPP} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;background:var(--color-whatsapp);color:white;padding:0.875rem 2rem;border-radius:9999px;font-weight:700;">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    </div>

    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
        {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is blind dropshipping and why does it matter?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Blind dropshipping means your customer receives a plain package with no reference to your supplier - no invoices, pricing, or supplier branding inside. This makes it look like you hold your own inventory and builds trust in your brand. We provide blind shipping for all dropshipping orders at no extra charge."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do I handle returns as a dropshipper?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Set up a clear returns policy on your store (7-day return window for unused items is standard). When a customer requests a return, you coordinate with us and either provide a replacement or refund. The key: respond within 24 hours, be accommodating, and handle the customer directly. How you handle returns defines your brand reputation more than the product itself."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is a realistic monthly income from activewear dropshipping?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most new dropshippers make $500-2,000/month in year one. After 12 months of optimization, $3,000-10,000/month is achievable. Top performers doing $20,000+/month combine multiple channels (Shopify + TikTok Shop + Instagram) and have built a following. Income scales with audience size and marketing skill, not just product quality."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need business licenses to dropship activewear?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "In most countries, a sole proprietorship is sufficient to start. Form an LLC once you exceed $1,000/month in revenue for liability protection. You do need to collect and remit sales tax once you have economic nexus in a state (typically $100K in sales). Use TaxJar or Avalara to automate sales tax compliance across states."
        }
    },
    {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do I handle customer complaints about shipping time?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Prevent complaints by setting accurate expectations on checkout pages. When complaints arise, acknowledge the delay, apologize, and offer a solution: partial refund, discount on next order, or express re-shipment. Keep the conversation on WhatsApp for fast resolution. Proactive communication turns complaining customers into loyal repeat buyers."
        }
    }
    ],
    })} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": SITE.url },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Resources", "item": SITE.url + "/resources" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Activewear Dropshipping: Complete Start-to-Scale Guide", "item": SITE.url + "/resources/undefined" },
    ],
    })} />

 <!-- FAQ accordion arrow rotation -->
 <script>
 document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
   const arrow = item.querySelector('.faq-arrow');
   if (arrow) {
     item.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
       arrow.style.transform = item.open ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';
     });
   }
 });
 </script>
</BaseLayout>